# $apply passes string-keyed dict entries as named args to the called function.
# When the function does not declare a parameter named "named", apply
# produces E022 (UnknownNamedArg).
# Note: $+ is a Tinct wrapper function; builtin-add is not in user scope.
[apply + [named: 1]]
=== error
[E023] + does not accept named arguments (defined at 4:1-4:21)
  in apply at 4:1-4:21
  in [apply ...] at 4:1-4:21

=== warn
cannot unify Fn@⊤ [⊤] with Fn@Number [a: Number b: Number] at 4:8-4:9
